WEBVTT
NOTE Cedwyn film, frame 005, en. Timings estimated from the script.

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.462
<v a carter who hauls the stone>Steady, steady now! Whoa there. All the way up the hill with this stone, Brother, and the oxen have earned their hay.

2
00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:26.042
<v a monk of Llandough>God bless their patience, and yours. The masons have finished their cutting. Look at the knotwork, Dai: one cord, over and under, never broken.

3
00:00:30.392 --> 00:00:35.008
<v a carter who hauls the stone>And the name cut on it? I can't read a letter, Brother.

4
00:00:35.358 --> 00:00:45.742
<v a monk of Llandough>Irbic. The name is cut here in the stone, and here it stays, by the church door, where every soul going in to pray must pass it.

5
00:00:46.092 --> 00:00:50.708
<v a monk of Llandough>Bless, O Lord, this cross, and all who pass it by. Amen.
